#: ../../examples/goal.rst:2
msgid "Iterate toward a goal"
msgstr "迭代逼近目标"

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:4
msgid "A ``goal_mode`` external event selects one future request. A private evaluator then reports incomplete and finally achieved. This demonstrates control flow, not real-model evaluation quality."
msgstr "``goal_mode`` 外部事件会选定接下来的某一次请求。随后一个私有评估器先报告未完成，最终报告已达成。这里演示的是控制流，而不是真实模型的评估质量。"

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:9
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:11
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录下执行："

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:17
msgid "The output includes:"
msgstr "输出包含："

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:23
msgid "This program uses deterministic offline models and temporary storage where needed. It requires no API key and is executed by the documentation test suite."
msgstr "这个程序在需要时使用确定性的离线模型和临时存储。它不需要 API 密钥，并由文档测试套件执行。"

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:27
msgid "Separate the worker from the reviewer"
msgstr "把执行者与审查者分开"

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:29
msgid "The application selects goal mode for a specific upcoming request. A reviewer checks the worker's result and can request another attempt:"
msgstr "应用为某个即将发出的请求选择目标模式。审查者检查执行者的结果，并可以要求再试一次："

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:36
msgid "Here the reviewer deliberately reports missing tests once, then accepts the second answer. In a real workflow, have it inspect concrete evidence rather than accepting the worker's claims. Bound continuation with an iteration limit and give the user a way to cancel; an evaluator is not a guarantee of correctness."
msgstr "这里审查者故意只报告一次缺少测试，然后接受第二次作答。在真实的工作流中，应让它检查具体的证据，而不是接受执行者的说法。请用迭代次数上限来限制继续执行，并为用户提供取消的途径；评估器并不能保证结果正确。"

#: ../../examples/goal.rst:43
msgid "Complete source"
msgstr "完整源码"

